WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.947
Open the notebook menu to configure the conversation.

00:00:01.947 --> 00:00:03.968
Choose the conversation goal and response length for the notebook.

00:00:03.968 --> 00:00:07.844
Select Learning Guide and shorter responses, then save these notebook settings.

00:00:07.844 --> 00:00:11.634
Review the saved Learning Guide goal and shorter response setting.
